{"id":"75f82c67aea114c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator.md","title":"ZFC Func Dense Domain Operator","display":"df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator — ZFC Func Dense Domain Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator — ZFC Func Dense Domain Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-func-dense-domain-operator — ZFC Func Dense Domain Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,Y,\\tau\\in V\">\\(T,X,Y,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}dense\\text{-}domain\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S(T,X,Y,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,A,B)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\subseteq X\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\to U\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\neq\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}dense\\text{-}domain\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S(T,X,Y,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,A,B)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\subseteq X\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\to U\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\neq\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Density is relative to the explicitly supplied topology on the operator's ambient domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, $\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V$, and $\\operatorname{ran}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,X,Y,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}dense\\text{-}domain\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncDenseDomainOperator}_S(T,X,Y,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,A,B)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\subseteq X\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n(x\\in U\\to U\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\neq\\varnothing)","display":true}],"bytes":1197,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-func-dense-domain-op